/target
/_workspace

# Presentation art and audio binaries are kept locally and synchronized through external asset
# storage. Keep source, creator, license, attribution, and modification records in tracked docs.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tga
*.ase
*.aseprite
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.flac
*.m4a
*.aac
*.opus
*.mid
*.midi

# The concept-art reference and future README screenshots are intentional tracked exceptions.
!/dreadstep-concept-art.png
!/screenshots/
!/screenshots/**
